","en":"The official language of the Court shall be French. The Court may, at the request of the contesting parties, authorise another language to be used before it.","full_text":""},"speaker":null,"sources":["Edition"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-1","weight":1.0,"end":37,"file":"all.p1.jsonl","lang":"fr","line":4538,"start":0}]}]},{"meeting":28,"section":"28","passages":[{"seg_id":"s0597.01","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":597,"printed":587,"texts":{"fr":"28 SÉANCE (non-publique), tenue au Palais de la Paix, à La Haye, le 20 juillet 1920.","en":"28 MEETING (Private), held at the Peace Palace, the Hague, on July 20, 1920.","full_text":""},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-1","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[597]}]},{"seg_id":"s0597.02","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":597,"printed":587,"texts":{"fr":"Présidence de M. le BARON DESCAMPS.","en":"BARON DESCAMPS in the chair.","full_text":""},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-1","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[597]}]},{"seg_id":"s0597.03","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":597,"printed":587,"texts":{"fr":"Sont présents : tous les membres du Comité (à l'exception de M. Bevilaqua); M. Fernandes; Mr. James Brown Scott; les secrétaires particuliers de M. le Baron Descamps et de M. Adatci; les membres du Secrétariat.","en":"Present : all the members of the Committee (except M. Bevilaqua); M. Fernandes; Mr. James Brown Scott; the private secretaries of Baron Descamps and M. Adatci; the members of the Secretariat.","full_text":""},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-1","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[597]}]},{"seg_id":"s0597.04","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":597,"printed":587,"texts":{"fr":"La séance est ouverte à 9.40 heures du matin.","en":"The meeting opened at 9.40 a.m.","full_text":""},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-1","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[597]}]},{"seg_id":"s0597.05","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":597,"printed":587,"texts":{"fr":"Le PRESIDENT, constatant que le Secrétariat a déjà fait distribuer les trois compte-rendus des séances de la veille, lui adresse les remerciements du Comité (Annexe No. 1); il déclare que, ce faisant, le Secrétariat a accompli un véritable tour de force. (Applaudissements).","en":"The PRESIDENT stated that the Secretariat had already distributed the three summaries of the meetings of the previous day, and expressed the thanks of the Committee (Annex No. 1). He said that the Secretariat had really achieved the impossible. (Applause).","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0597.05","speaker_id":"descamps","certain":true,"name":"Baron Édouard Descamps","role":"member"},"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-1","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[597]}]},{"seg_id":"s0597.06","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":597,"printed":587,"texts":{"fr":"On passe à la discussion du Chapitre III (procédure) du texte soumis par le Comité de Rédaction.","en":"The Committee then proceeded to discuss Chapter III (Procedure) of the text submitted by the Drafting Committee.","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0597.06","speaker_id":"descamps","certain":true,"name":"Baron Édouard Descamps","role":"member"},"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-1","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[597]}]},{"seg_id":"s0597.07","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":597,"printed":587,"texts":{"fr":"Article 1.","en":"Article 1.","full_text":""},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-1","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[597]}]},{"seg_id":"s0597.08","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":597,"printed":587,"texts":{"fr":"Cet article est adopté sans discussion.","en":"This Article was adopted without discussion.","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0597.08","speaker_id":"collective","certain":false,"name":"The Committee (impersonal)","role":"collective"},"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-1","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[597]}]},{"seg_id":"s0597.09","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":597,"printed":587,"texts":{"fr":"Article 2.","en":"Article 2.","full_text":""},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-1","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[597]}]},{"seg_id":"s0597.10","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":597,"printed":587,"texts":{"fr":"LORD PHILLIMORE attire l'attention sur l'article 23 du chapitre III et soulève la question du droit d'intervention. Il croit que l'alinéa 4 est inutile si ce droit n'est pas admis dans une mesure plus large que cela n'a été fait dans l'article 23, qui parle seulement de traités généraux.","en":"LORD PHILLIMORE called attention to Article 23 of Chapter III, and raised the question of the right of intervention. He thought that Paragraph 4 would be useless if this right were not conceded to a wider extent than had been done in Article 23, which only mentioned general treaties.","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0597.10","speaker_id":"phillimore","certain":true,"name":"Lord Phillimore","role":"member"},"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-1","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[597]}]},{"seg_id":"s0597.11","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":597,"printed":587,"texts":{"fr":"Le PRESIDENT et M. DE LAPRADELLE font valoir que l'alinéa a deux autres buts :","en":"The PRESIDENT and M. DE LAPRADELLE pointed out that the Paragraph had two other objects :","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0597.11","speaker_id":"descamps","certain":true,"name":"Baron Édouard Descamps","role":"member"},"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-1","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[597]}]},{"seg_id":"s0597.12","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":597,"printed":587,"texts":{"fr":"1. notification pour autres fins que l'intervention; 2. tenir lieu de stipulation concernant la publicité.","en":"1. Notification for purposes other than intervention; 2. To take the place of a provision regulating publicity.","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0597.12","speaker_id":"descamps","certain":true,"name":"Baron Édouard Descamps","role":"member"},"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-1","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[597]}]},{"seg_id":"s0597.13","meeting":28,"doc":"minutes","pdf":597,"printed":587,"texts":{"fr":"M. FERNANDES propose la formule suivante : „Le droit d'intervention est reconnu aux Etats ayant un intérêt légitime, soit d'assister une des parties en cause, en raison d'un droit conjoint, soit d'exclure le demandeur ou le défendeur. Dans le premier cas, l'intervenant agira dans les mêmes délais…","en":"M. FERNANDES proposed the following wording : “The right of intervention is granted to States having a legitimate interest, either to assist one of the contesting parties, by reason of a joint right, or to debar the plaintiff or the defendant. In the former case, the intervening party shall conform…","full_text":""},"speaker":{"seg_id":"s0597.13","speaker_id":"fernandes","certain":true,"name":"Raul Fernandes","role":"member"},"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-1","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[597]}]}]},{"meeting":30,"section":"30","passages":[{"seg_id":"s0647.01","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":647,"printed":637,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"ANNEXE No. 3."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-1","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[647]}]},{"seg_id":"s0647.02","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":647,"printed":637,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"CHAPITRE III."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-1","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[647]}]},{"seg_id":"s0647.03","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":647,"printed":637,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"(Texte revisé du Comité de rédaction, avec, en regard, compte-rendu des délibérations du Comité, du 20 juillet.)"},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-1","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[647]}]},{"seg_id":"s0647.04","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":647,"printed":637,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Article 1."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-1","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[647]}]},{"seg_id":"s0647.05","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":647,"printed":637,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Article 2 bis."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-1","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[647]}]},{"seg_id":"s0647.06","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":647,"printed":637,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Adopté."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-1","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[647]}]},{"seg_id":"s0647.07","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":647,"printed":637,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Article 2."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-1","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[647]}]},{"seg_id":"s0647.08","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":647,"printed":637,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Adopté."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-1","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[647]}]},{"seg_id":"s0647.09","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":647,"printed":637,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"LORD PHILLIMORE attire l'attention sur l'article 23 du chapitre III et soulève la question du droit d'intervention."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-1","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[647]}]},{"seg_id":"s0647.10","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":647,"printed":637,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Il croit que l'alinéa 4 est inutile si ce droit n'est pas admis dans une mesure plus large que cela n'a été fait dans l'article 23, qui parle seulement de traités généraux."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-1","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[647]}]},{"seg_id":"s0647.11","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":647,"printed":637,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Le PRESIDENT et le Rapporteur font valoir que l'alinéa a deux autres buts :"},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-1","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[647]}]},{"seg_id":"s0647.12","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":647,"printed":637,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"1. notification pour autre fin qu'intervention ;"},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-1","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[647]}]},{"seg_id":"s0647.13","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":647,"printed":637,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"2. tenir lieu de stipulation concernant la publicité des procès."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-1","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[647]}]},{"seg_id":"s0647.14","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":647,"printed":637,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"M. FERNANDES a proposé la formule suivante :"},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-1","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[647]}]},{"seg_id":"s0647.15","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":647,"printed":637,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"„Le droit d'intervention est reconnu aux Etats ayant un intérêt légitime, soit d'assister une des parties en cause, en raison d'un droit conjoint, soit pour exclure le demandeur ou le défendeur. Dans le premier cas, l'intervenant agira dans les mêmes délais accordés à la partie assistée. Dans le…"},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-1","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[647]}]},{"seg_id":"s0647.16","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":647,"printed":637,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"M. HAGERUP a proposé la formule de l'article 31 du projet des 3 pays scandinaves qui ne limite pas la notification et l'intervention aux Membres de la Société des Nations."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-1","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[647]}]},{"seg_id":"s0647.17","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":647,"printed":637,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Adopté (avec modifications rédactionnelles)."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-1","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[647]}]},{"seg_id":"s0647.18","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":647,"printed":637,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"M. FERNANDES voudrait voir appuyer les mesures conservatoires par des sanctions efficaces."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-1","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[647]}]},{"seg_id":"s0647.19","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":647,"printed":637,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"MM. ROOT, LORD PHILLIMORE, MM. ADATCI et DE LAPRADELLE s'opposent à cette idée qui leur semble imprudente."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-1","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[647]}]},{"seg_id":"s0647.20","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":647,"printed":637,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Procédure."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-1","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[647]}]},{"seg_id":"s0647.21","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":647,"printed":637,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"La langue de la Cour est le français."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-1","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[647]}]},{"seg_id":"s0647.22","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":647,"printed":637,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"La Cour peut, à la demande des parties, autoriser l'emploi d'une autre langue devant elle."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-1","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[647]}]},{"seg_id":"s0647.23","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":647,"printed":637,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"La Cour est saisie par une requête adressée au Greffe."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-1","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[647]}]},{"seg_id":"s0647.24","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":647,"printed":637,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"La requête indique l'objet du différend et désigne les parties en cause."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-1","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[647]}]},{"seg_id":"s0647.25","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":647,"printed":637,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Le Greffe fait immédiatement notification de la requête aux intéressés."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-1","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[647]}]},{"seg_id":"s0647.26","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":647,"printed":637,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Il en informe également les Membres de la Société des Nations par l'entremise du Secrétaire-Général."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-1","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[647]}]},{"seg_id":"s0647.27","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":647,"printed":637,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"Dans le cas où la cause du différend consiste en un acte effectué ou sur le point de l'être, la Cour a le pouvoir d'indiquer, si elle estime que les circonstances l'exigent, quelles mesures conservatoires du droit de chacun doivent être prises à titre provisoire."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-1","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[647]}]},{"seg_id":"s0647.28","meeting":30,"doc":"annex","pdf":647,"printed":637,"texts":{"fr":"","en":"","full_text":"En attendant l'arrêt, cette indication de ces mesures est immédiatement transmise aux parties et au Conseil."},"speaker":null,"sources":["Index 1920"],"evidence":[{"concept":"c.drafting-committee-draft-scheme-procedure-article-1","printed":"Index 1920","weight":0.3,"pages":[647]}]}]}],"histogram":[{"meeting":1,"count":0},{"meeting":2,"count":0},{"meeting":3,"count":0},{"meeting":4,"count":0},{"meeting":5,"count":0},{"meeting":6,"count":0},{"meeting":7,"count":0},{"meeting":8,"count":0},{"meeting":9,"count":0},{"meeting":10,"count":0},{"meeting":11,"count":0},{"meeting":12,"count":0},{"meeting":13,"count":0},{"meeting":14,"count":0},{"meeting":15,"count":0},{"meeting":16,"count":0},{"meeting":17,"count":0},{"meeting":18,"count":0},{"meeting":19,"count":0},{"meeting":20,"count":0},{"meeting":21,"count":0},{"meeting":22,"count":0},{"meeting":23,"count":0},{"meeting":24,"count":0},{"meeting":25,"count":1},{"meeting":26,"count":0},{"meeting":27,"count":0},{"meeting":28,"count":13},{"meeting":29,"count":0},{"meeting":30,"count":28},{"meeting":31,"count":0},{"meeting":32,"count":0},{"meeting":33,"count":0},{"meeting":34,"count":0},{"meeting":35,"count":0}],"members":[{"id":"descamps","name":"Baron Édouard Descamps","count":4},{"id":"phillimore","name":"Lord Phillimore","count":1},{"id":"fernandes","name":"Raul Fernandes","count":1}],"passage_count":42,"sources":["Edition","Index 1920"],"includes_descendants":false}